				<div class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 300px;">			<div class="game_area_description" data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}">
				<h2>NBA 2K27 Deluxe Edition</h2>				<p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/58577a08cf1ef76a0bc0bf24269fd8f9.avif?t=1792163139" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>This edition includes:</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >100,000 VC</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>MyTEAM (all cards &amp; packs are unauctionable):</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Full ‘27: Series 1 Team Selection</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Triple Threat Park Free Agent Pack</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >5x ‘27: Series 1 Packs</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >2-Hour 2XP Coin</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>MyCAREER:</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >25x 6 Types of Skill Boosts</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >25x 3 Types of Gatorade Boosts</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >2-Hour 2XP Coin</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Victor Wembanyama Jersey</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Caitlin Clark Jersey</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><i>Play Now, MyNBA, and The W are available offline. All other game modes and features require Internet connection, may require online account registration and may not be available to all users at all times.</i></p></p>
			</div>
